meta {
  name: 53-org-groups
  seq: 53
}

docs {
  Groups in the admin console: a set of members that gets a set of
  collections. Needs `50-org-admin-setup`. The group holds the owner's
  membership, which no other folder removes.

  `GroupResponse`: Id, OrganizationId, Name, ExternalId. `GroupDetailsResponse`
  adds Collections. `GroupRequest` sends `name`, `collections` and `users`
  (membership ids); NodeWarden's own web vault sends `members`.
}
